        "openspec"
      ],
      "coordinatorNotes": "Spec already completed and approved. openspec was applied, coordinator review verdict is 'approved', status is 'completed'. No further spec agent work needed. Re-running would duplicate prior results and violate the skip-already-curated policy.",
