          "notes": "The existing code in src/hello.ts already returns 'hello dolly', which matches the story intent. The story is framed as a defect (greeting should say hello dolly, implying it currently says hello world), but the fix site already produces the correct value. No code change appears necessary; the defect may have already been resolved or may be upstream.",
          "acceptanceChanged": false,
          "splitCount": 0,
